title: Relay connector can remain wedged with stale sync while process stays alive
updated_at: "2026-07-15T15:15:46Z"
---
Dogfood follow-up to B181. GitHub issue: https://github.com/clankercode/c2c/issues/5. On host 3d08761ae3f3, c2c 0.12.0 5faddd4b, whoami reported registered_unreachable and a connector process present while last successful sync was hours stale. Monitor then emitted request_timeout for tens of minutes. The process PID is not sufficient bridge health. Investigate connector liveness, watchdog/restart behavior, timeout classification, and monitor escalation. Acceptance: a live PID with stale bridge is detected promptly; recovery is automatic or one safe documented command; monitor reports a bounded actionable failure instead of indefinite timeout spam.